+// BotW-BetterVR on PS5: the console has one graphics queue, which Cemu's GPU thread, the submit
+// thread and the OpenXR runtime over hmd2 (port/bettervr/xr) share. Every submission or present on it
+// holds this lock, as Vulkan asks of a queue used from more than one thread.
+#ifdef __PROSPERO__
